# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in here is source. Everything listed is either huge, personal,
# unit-specific, or a build artefact that can be regenerated.
# If you find yourself wanting to commit one of these, add it to a Release
# asset instead (see artifacts/README.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Firmware and vendor tooling (multi-GB, not ours to redistribute) ------
FW/
Tool/
*.tar.md5
*.ofp
*.ozip
*.mbn
*.scatter

# --- Unit-specific backups: NEVER publish -----------------------------------
# persist/nvram/nvdi contain keys unique to one physical device. Publishing
# or restoring these across units is unrecoverable.
backup/
readback*/
physical-readback/
*.bak
persist.img
nvram.img
nvdi.img
nvdata.img
proinfo.img
seccfg.img
protect1.img
protect2.img
nvcfg.img
otp.img

# --- Images and archives ----------------------------------------------------
*.img
*.img.gz
*.img.xz
*.img.zst
super*.img
*.bin
*.sparse
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# --- Build trees and outputs ------------------------------------------------
build/
out/
work/
lineage*/
.repo/
target_files/
signed-target_files.zip

# --- Logs and diagnostics ---------------------------------------------------
*.log
logcat*
dmesg*
last_kmsg*
bugreport*
*.trace
*.perfetto
perf.data

# --- Screenshots / photos / recordings --------------------------------------
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.bmp
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.wav
*.mp3
!docs/**/*.png

# --- APKs / APEX / split payloads (third-party, do not redistribute) --------
*.apk
*.apks
*.apex
*.capex
*.xapk
drminfo*/
drminfo-apks/

# --- Signing material: NEVER publish ----------------------------------------
# Private keys. Losing control of these means anyone can sign "your" builds.
*.pk8
*.pem
*.x509.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
.android-certs/
vendor/lineage-priv/
keys/
avb_custom_key.bin

# --- Credentials and environment -------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
secrets*
*askpass*
*.secret
*.token
*.netrc
.git-credentials
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
authorized_keys
known_hosts

# --- Editor / OS cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.cache/
tmp/

# --- Python / misc tooling --------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
